OpenColorIO-rs

A Rust port of OpenColorIO (https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/OpenColorIO).
Each release states the OpenColorIO version it matches; this line matches
OpenColorIO 2.5.2 (upstream tag v2.5.2, commit c52966a6677723d5bd2dbef0ccec3fed9cbc3790).

The port is a derivative work of OpenColorIO and is distributed under the same
BSD-3-Clause license (see LICENSE):

    Copyright Contributors to the OpenColorIO Project.

Test data under fixtures/ is generated by the official OpenColorIO 2.5.2 Python
wheel (PyPI: opencolorio==2.5.2). Test data and tests ported from upstream's
tests/ directory keep upstream's BSD-3-Clause license and notice.

Third-party code ported into this repository
--------------------------------------------

Imath 3.2.1 (https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/Imath), the half-float
conversions OpenColorIO 2.5.2 uses (half.h, half.cpp), ported in
crates/ocio-ops/src/imath_half.rs:

